<title>AUSTRIA: BWT Q1 net profit up 18 pct at 15 mln ATS.</title>
<headline>BWT Q1 net profit up 18 pct at 15 mln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian water treatment company BWT said on Monday first quarter net profit rose to 15 million schillings from 12.7 million in the year-ago period, boosted by a 35 percent jump in order backlog to 479 million schillings.</p>
</text>
